#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:101 index.docbook:502
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kfloppy; depends on external programs and therefore currently works "
"<emphasis>only</emphasis> with &Linux; and &BSD;. Depending if you are using "
"&kfloppy; on &Linux; or on &BSD;, &kfloppy; has slightly different features."
msgstr ""
"&kfloppy; zavisi od vanjskih programa i zato trenutno radi <emphasis>samo</"
"emphasis> sa &Linux; i &BSD;. Ovisno da li koristite &kfloppy; na &Linux; "
"ili na &BSD;, &kfloppy; ima nešto različite funkcije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111 index.docbook:123 index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure that your floppy disk is <emphasis>not</emphasis> mounted. "
"&kfloppy; cannot format a mounted floppy disk."
msgstr ""
"Pobrinite se da vasa disketa <emphasis> nije </emphasis> montirana. "
"&kfloppy; ne moze formatirati montiranu disketu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kfloppy;"
msgstr "Korištenje &kfloppy;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starting &kfloppy; opens a single window by which the user may choose "
"appropriate settings and control the formatting process. These options and "
"controls are detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Pokretanje &kfloppy; otvara jedan prozor pomoću kojeg korisnik može odabrati "
"odgovarajuće postavke i kontrolisati proces formatiranja. Ove opcije i "
"kontrole su navedene ispod."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Control Settings"
msgstr "Postavke kontrole"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The settings are chosen by means of three drop down boxes located at the top "
"left center of &kfloppy;."
msgstr ""
"Postavke su izabrane putem tri padajuća prozora locirana u gornjem lijevom "
"centru &kfloppy;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Floppy Drive"
msgstr "Disketna jedinica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking on the top drop down box, which is labeled <guilabel>Floppy drive:</"
"guilabel>, offers the user the following two choices:"
msgstr ""
"Klikom na padajući prozor na vrhu, koji je označen kao <guilabel>Disk:</"
"guilabel>, korisniku se nude sljedeće dvije mogućnosti:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Primary"
msgstr "Primarno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Secondary"
msgstr "Sekundarni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking on the second drop down box from the top, which is labeled "
"<guilabel>Size:</guilabel>, offers the user the following four choices:"
msgstr ""
"Klikom na drugi po redu padajući prozor, koji je označen kao "
"<guilabel>Veličina:</guilabel>, korisniku se nude sljedeća četiri izbora:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "3.5\" 1.44MB"
msgstr "3.5\" 1.44MB"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "3.5\" 720KB"
msgstr "3.5\" 720KB"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "5.25\" 1.2MB"
msgstr "5.25\" 1.2MB"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "5.25\" 360KB"
msgstr "5.25\" 360KB"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &Linux; version of &kfloppy; has also a choice of size named:"
msgstr "&Linux; verzija &kfloppy; također ima izbor veličine imenovan:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto-Detect"
msgstr "Auto-detekcija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The 800KB disk format used by <hardware>&Mac; floppy drives</hardware> "
"cannot be supported on <hardware>PC floppy drives</hardware> since they are "
"not capable of formatting disks in that fashion."
msgstr ""
"Format diska od 800KB korišten od strane <hardware>&Mac; diskovi</hardware> "
"ne može biti podržan na <hardware>diskovi na računaru</hardware> jer oni "
"nisu u stanju da vrše formatiranje diskova na taj način."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "File Systems"
msgstr "Datotečni sistemi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The third drop down box, labeled File System, offers the user the following "
"choices, if they are applicable:"
msgstr ""
"Treći padajući prozor, nazvan sistem datoteka, nudi korisniku navedene "
"izbore, ako su oni primjenljivi:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Dos</term>"
msgstr "<term>Dos</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This selection will have &kfloppy; place the MS-DOS/&Windows; type of file "
"system on the diskette. The user will most likely want to choose this system "
"if she or he will be using the diskette with those operating systems as they "
"do not recognize other system types. (This is supported for &Linux; and "
"&BSD;.)"
msgstr ""
"Ovim odabirom će &kfloppy; staviti MS-DOS/&Windows; tip sistema datoteka na "
"disketu. Korisnik će najviše poželjeti da izabere ovaj sistem, ako on ili "
"ona bude koristio/la disketu sa tim operativnim sistemima, kako oni ne "
"priznaju druge vrste sistema. (Ovo je podržano za &Linux;, i &BSD;.)"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "ext2"
msgstr "ext2"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This selection will have &kfloppy; place the type of file system on the "
"diskette which is most commonly used with &Linux;, however seldomly on "
"floppy disks. (This is supported for &Linux; and &BSD;.)"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj odabir će imati &kfloppy; smjestite tip sistema datoteka na disketu "
"koja je najčešće korištena sa &Linux;, međutim rijetko na disku. (Ovo je "
"podržano za &Linux; i za &BSD;.)"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>UFS</term>"
msgstr "<term>UFS</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This selection will have &kfloppy; place the type of file system on the "
"diskette which is most commonly used with <trademark class=\"registered"
"\">FreeBSD</trademark>. The user will likely want to choose this system if "
"he or she will only be using the floppy disk with <trademark class="
"\"registered\">FreeBSD</trademark>. (This is supported for &BSD; only.)"
msgstr ""
"Ovim odabirom će &kfloppy; smjestiti tip datotečnog sistema na disketu koja "
"je najčešće korištena sa <trademark class=\"registered\">FreeBSD</"
"trademark>. Korisnik će najviše željeti odabrati ovaj sistem ako će on ili "
"ona koristiti ovaj disk sa  <trademark class=\"registered\">FreeBSD</"
"trademark>. (Ovo je podržano samo za &BSD;.)"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Minix;"
msgstr "&Minix;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This selection will have &kfloppy; place the type of file system on the "
"diskette which often used on floppy disks used with &Linux;, (This is "
"supported for &Linux; only.)"
msgstr ""
"Ova oznaka će omogućiti da &kfloppy; smjesti tip datotečnog sistema na "
"disketu koja je često korištena na diskovima sa &Linux;, (Ovo je podržano "
"samo za &Linux;.)"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "Formatting Options"
msgstr "Opcije formatiranja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Within the outline of a box in the left center of &kfloppy; the user may "
"find a set of five formatting options. The top two are a pair of radio "
"buttons."
msgstr ""
"U okviru obrisa kutije u lijevom centru &kfloppy; korisnik može naći komplet "
"od pet opcija formatiranja. Prva dva su par radio dugmadi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This term (radio buttons) indicates a set of options among which only one "
"can be selected - in the same way that only one preset channel selection may "
"be set on a car radio."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj termin (radio dugmadi) označava skup opcija među kojima samo jedan može "
"biti izabran - na isti način na koji se samo jedan postavljeni izbor kanala "
"može postaviti na radio u autu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The bottom two options are for labeling the diskette. All are explained "
"below:"
msgstr ""
"Dole navedene dvije opcije se odnose na označavanje diskete.  Objašnjene su "
"u nastavku:"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "Formatting Method"
msgstr "Metoda formatiranja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kfloppy; can format a disk in the following two ways:"
msgstr "&kfloppy; može formatirati disk na slijedeća dva načina:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quick Format"
msgstr "Brzo formatiranje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "This simply puts the new file system on the disk."
msgstr "Ovo jednostavno stavlja novi datotečni sistem na disk."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:241
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "All data on the disk will be lost, even if the data itself will not "
#| "erased."
msgid ""
"All data on the disk will be lost, even if the data itself will not be "
"erased."
msgstr ""
"Sav sadržaj na disku će biti izgubljen, čak i ako sadržaj neće biti obrisan "
"sam od sebe."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zero out and quick format"
msgstr "Zero out i brzo formatiranje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This format first puts zeros on the disk and then creates the new file "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj format prvo stavlja nule na disk i onda kreira novi sistem datoteka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:248 index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "All data on the disk will be erased."
msgstr "Svi podaci na disku bit će obrisani."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full Format"
msgstr "Potpuno formatiranje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A full format reallocates the tracks and sectors, puts the selected file "
"system on the disk, and then verifies the format, blocking out any bad "
"sectors it finds."
msgstr ""
"Potpuno formatiranje realocira staze i sektore, stavlja odabrani sistem "
"datoteka na disku, a zatim provjerava format, blokirajući bilo koje loše "
"sektore koje pronađe."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid "Verify Integrity"
msgstr "Provjerite integritet"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tells &kfloppy; to check that the formatting was correctly written to "
"the floppy. This allows bad sectors to be identified."
msgstr ""
"To govori &kfloppy; da provjeri da li je formatiranje ispravno napisano na "
"disketi. To omogućava da se identifikuju loši sektori."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:271
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If bad sectors a found during the verify phase of a Full Format, the "
#| "formatting is aborted and the file system is not written!"
msgid ""
"If bad sectors are found during the verify phase of a Full Format, the "
"formatting is aborted and the file system is not written!"
msgstr ""
"Ako su nađeni loši sektori prilikom provjere faze Potpuni format, "
"formatiranje je prekinuto i sistem datoteka nije napisan!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "Volume Label"
msgstr "Labela uređaja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The bottom two features allow the user to add (or change) a label to the "
"diskette. If the <guilabel>Volume label:</guilabel> check box is selected "
"then the user can enter a name (label) for the diskette that is to be "
"formatted in the text box located immediately below. When the diskette is "
"subsequently formatted the label will be written to the diskette."
msgstr ""
"Donje dvije osobine omogućavaju korisniku da doda (ili promijeni) oznaku na "
"disketi. Ako je <guilabel>Naziv volumena:</guilabel> izabran onda korisnik "
"može upisati ime (labelu) za disketu koja će biti formatirana u okviru za "
"tekst koji se nalazi odmah ispod. Kada je disketa naknadno formatirana "
"etiketa će biti napisana na disketi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Due to a limitation of the DOS file system, a label can only be at most 11 "
"characters long. For simplification, &kfloppy; assumes that this limit is "
"true for all file systems."
msgstr ""
"Zbog ograničenja u DOS sistemu datoteka, a etiketa može biti duga najviše 11 "
"znakova. Za pojednostavljenje, &kfloppy; pretpostavlja da to ograničenje "
"važi i za sve sisteme datoteka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The file system &Minix; cannot have any volume label. In this case, "
"&kfloppy; will ignore the volume label."
msgstr ""
"Sistem datoteka &Minix; ne može imati nikakvu labelu volumena. U ovom "
"slučaju &kfloppy; će ignorisati labelu volumena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Buttons"
msgstr "Dugmad"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are three buttons located vertically along the right side of &kfloppy;."
msgstr "Postoje tri dugmeta locirana vertikalno uz desnu stranu &kfloppy;."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "Format"
msgstr "Formatiranje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This button initiates the formatting process. Once the user is sure that all "
"the settings are correct he or she may begin the process by clicking on this "
"button. There will be a change in the two long rectangular boxes that span "
"the bottom of &kfloppy;."
msgstr ""
"Ovo dugme inicira proces formatiranja. Kada je korisnik siguran da su sve "
"postavke ispravne on ili ona može započeti proces klikom na ovu tipku. Tu će "
"biti promjena u dvije duge pravougaone kutije koje se prostiru na dnu "
"&kfloppy;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The upper box is a status indicator that gives information about the process "
"underway, especially the error encountered during the processing."
msgstr ""
"Gornja kutija je indikator statusa koja daje informacije o toku procesa, "
"posebno o pronađenim greškama tokom obrade."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The lower box is a progress bar. This displays both graphically and "
"numerically the progress of first the formatting and then the verification. "
"Before starting it appears to be empty - showing only the figure 0% in the "
"center. As each process takes place the progress is tracked graphically as "
"the box fills from left to right. At the same time the number in the center "
"will increase reflecting the precise percentage of the process that has been "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"Donja kutija je traka koja prati napredak. Ovo prikazuje i grafički i "
"numerički napredak prvog formatiranja i onda verifikaciju. Prije početka "
"čini se da je prazna - pokazuje se samo brojka 0% u centru. Kao što svaki "
"proces zauzima mjesto, napredak se prati grafički kako se kutija popunjava s "
"lijeva na desno. Istovremeno se broj u centru će se povećava odražavajući "
"precizno postotak procesa koji je završen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As &kfloppy; uses external programs to format the floppy disk, it has to "
"rely on these programs to give the right information for being able to "
"display the progress bar. Unfortunately, this is not the case. Especially, "
"the programs writing the file systems do not return enough data, so that the "
"progress bar will remain at 0%."
msgstr ""
"Kako &kfloppy; koristi eksterne programe za formatiranje diskete, mora se "
"osloniti na ove programe i dati pravu informaciju za omogućavanje prikaza "
"trake napretka. Nažalost, to nije ovaj slučaj. Posebno, programi koji pišu "
"sisteme datoteka ne vraćaju dovoljno podataka, tako da će traka napretka "
"ostati na 0%."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kfloppy; does <emphasis>not</emphasis> unmount the floppy by itself, as "
"this could mean that the user may overwrite a floppy disk with important "
"data on it."
msgstr ""
"&kfloppy; radi <emphasis>not</emphasis> demontiranje diskete sam, jer bi to "
"moglo značiti da korisnik može prepisati disketu koja ima važne podatke na "
"sebi."

