#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:442
#, no-c-format
msgid "Needed External Programs"
msgstr "Potrebni vanjski programi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:444
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As already written earlier in this handbook, &kfloppy; works with the help "
"of external programs to do the different formatting tasks."
msgstr ""
"Kako je već ranije napisano u ovom priručniku, &kfloppy; radi uz pomoć "
"eksternih programa koji rade različite zadatke formatiranja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If one of the programs is missing, &kfloppy; tries to work nevertheless. "
"However the corresponding option will not be available."
msgstr ""
"Ako jedan od programa nedostaje, &kfloppy; ipak pokušava da radi. Međutim, "
"odgovarajuća opcija neće biti dostupna."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This program is needed for low-level formatting, on &Linux; and on &BSD;. If "
"it is missing, <guilabel>Full format</guilabel> will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj program je potreban za formatiranje nižeg nivoa, na &Linux; i na &BSD;. "
"Ako ga nema <guilabel>Potpuni format</guilabel> će biti onemogućen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This program is needed for zeroing-out, on &Linux; and on &BSD;. If it is "
"missing, <guilabel>Zero out and quick format</guilabel> will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj program je potreban za anuliranje-out, na &Linux; i na &BSD;. Ako ga "
"nema, <guilabel>Zero out i brzo formatiranje</guilabel> će biti onemogućeno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:467
#, no-c-format
msgid "This program is needed for DOS formatting, on &Linux;."
msgstr "Ovaj program je potreban za DOS formatiranje, na &Linux;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:473
#, no-c-format
msgid "This program is needed for DOS formatting, on &BSD;."
msgstr "Ovaj program je potreban za DOS formatiranje, na &BSD;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:479
#, no-c-format
msgid "This program is needed for UFS formatting, on &BSD;."
msgstr "Ovaj program je potreban za UFS formatiranje, na &BSD;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid "This program is needed for ext2 formatting, on &Linux; and on &BSD;."
msgstr "Ovaj program je potreban za ext2 formatiranje, na &Linux; i na &BSD;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:491
#, no-c-format
msgid "This program is needed for &Minix; formatting, on &Linux;."
msgstr "Ovaj program je potreban za &Minix; formatiranje, na &Linux;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:499
#, no-c-format
msgid "User-Given Devices"
msgstr "Korisnički dati uređaji"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:504
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\"User Given Devices\" is the work title of a still experimental feature of "
"&kfloppy;. It allows the user to give a device name and to use it nearly as "
"if it was a <hardware>floppy drive</hardware>."
msgstr ""
"\"Korisnički dati uređaji\" je naslov tada još uvijek eksperimentalne "
"karakteristike &kfloppy;. Dozvoljava korisniku da da ime uređaju i koristi "
"ga skoro kao da je <hardware>disk</hardware>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This feature is mainly intended as a work-around for users having "
"<hardware>USB floppy drives</hardware> of any kind (including "
"<trademark>ZIP</trademark> disk drives) or any other non-legacy "
"<hardware>floppy drives</hardware>."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija je uglavnom namjenjena za raditi okolo za korisnike koji imaju "
"<hardware>USB disk</hardware> bilo koje vrste (uključujući <trademark>ZIP</"
"trademark> diskove) ili bilo koje druge ilegalne <hardware>diskove</"
"hardware>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unfortunately at the time of writing this documentation, the feature is not "
"very user friendly, as it does not offer any help to the user on how a "
"device is called and &kfloppy; does not even remember the device name from "
"call to call. (This is partially a security, as the device of the "
"<hardware>floppy drive</hardware> might change between reboots.)"
msgstr ""
"Nažalost, za vrijeme pisanja ove dokumentacije, mogućnost nije baš "
"prijateljski nastrojena, kako ne nudi nikakvu pomoć za korisnika o tome kako "
"je uređaj nazvan i &kfloppy; se čak ni ne sjeća imena uređaja od poziva do "
"poziva. (Ovo je djelomično i dio sigurnosti, kako se uređaj  <hardware>disk</"
"hardware> može mijenjati između restartovanja.)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:519
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As this feature was developed under &Linux;, the &BSD; version of &kfloppy; "
"offers less choices than &kfloppy; under &Linux;."
msgstr ""
"Kako je ova mogućnost razvijena na &Linux;, &BSD; verzija &kfloppy; nudi "
"manje izbora nego &kfloppy; na &Linux;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:525
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using It"
msgstr "Koristeći to"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:528
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using \"User Given Devices\" is quite simple, you just need to enter a "
"device name, for example <replaceable>/dev/sdz4</replaceable> in the "
"<guilabel>Floppy drive:</guilabel> combobox instead of selecting Primary or "
"Secondary."
msgstr ""
"Korištenje \"korisnički datih uređaja\" je prilično jednostavno, samo "
"trebate unijeti ime uređaja, na primjer <replaceable>/dev/sdz4</replaceable> "
"u <guilabel>Disk:</guilabel> kutiju umjesto označavanja Primarni ili "
"Sekundarni."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:534
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You need to enter the <filename class=\"directory\">/dev/</filename> part of "
"the device for two reasons:"
msgstr ""
"Trebate upisati <filename class=\"directory\">/dev/</filename> dio uređaja "
"iz dva razloga:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid "It is how &kfloppy; recognizes the \"User Given Devices\" mode."
msgstr "Tako &kfloppy; prepoznaje \"Korisnički date uređaje\" režim."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:541
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "It is a security, to avoid that the user writes anything in the combobox "
#| "that is by change a device name."
msgid ""
"It is a security, to avoid that the user writes anything in the combobox "
"that is by chance a device name."
msgstr ""
"To je sigurnost, izbjeći da korisnik napiše bilo šta u kutiju osim imena "
"uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:547
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, using any device instead of a floppy device has a few "
"consequences. The major one is that <guilabel>Full Format</guilabel> cannot "
"be selected anymore. Doing so will result in a error message box when trying "
"to start the format. However you can use <guilabel>Zero out and quick "
"format</guilabel> instead. It will not format the device, just zeroing it "
"out, but in practice it is nearly the same; especially all data on the "
"device will be erased."
msgstr ""
"Nažalost, korištenje bilo kojeg uređaja umjesto disketnog uređaja ima "
"nekoliko posljedica. Glavna je da <guilabel>Potpuno formatiranje</guilabel> "
"se više ne može odabrati. To će rezultirati porukom o grešci prilikom "
"pokušaja početka formatiranja. Međutim možete koristiti <guilabel>Zero out i "
"brzo formatiranje</guilabel> umjesto toga. To neće formatirati uređaj, samo "
"će ga anulirati, ali u praksi je to gotovo isto; Posebno će biti izbrisani "
"svi podaci na uređaju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:554
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Be careful when entering the device name. &kfloppy; will pass the device "
"name as is to the external programs. Especially it does not check (and the "
"external programs do not check either) if the device is a <hardware>floppy "
"drive</hardware> device. If you give your any of your main disk partitions "
"as device, it will be accepted. (If the partition is mounted or if you "
"cannot write on this device, you will probably get an error message "
"nevertheless, avoiding the worst.)"
msgstr ""
"Budite oprezni pri upisivanju imena uređaja. &kfloppy; će propustiti ime "
"uređaja kakvo jeste sve do vanjskih programa. Posebno se to ne provjerava "
"(ni eksterni programi to ne provjeravaju) ako je uređaj <hardware>disk</"
"hardware> uređaj. Ako date bilo koji od vaših glavnih diskova kao uređaj, to "
"će biti prihvaćen. (Ako se montira particija ili ako ne možete pisati na "
"ovom uređaju, vjerojatno ćete dobiti poruku o grešci, ipak, izbjegavajući "
"najgore.)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:562
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Even if you can specify a floppy device like <filename>/dev/fd0u2880</"
"filename>, &kfloppy; will refuse to make a <guilabel>Full Format</guilabel> "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"Čak i ako možete specificirati disk kao <filename>/dev/fd0u2880</filename>, "
"&kfloppy; će odbijati da napravi <guilabel>Potpuno formatiranje</guilabel> "
"na njemu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On &Linux;, you can select any file system that you want. On &BSD;, only UFS "
"is currently supported (and not tested at time of writing this "
"documentation)."
msgstr ""
"Na &Linux;, možete označiti bilo koji datotečni sistem koji želite. Na "
"&BSD;, samo je UFS trenutno podržan (i nije testiran u vrijeme pisanja ove "
"dokumentacije)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:570
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are ready to format, click on the <guibutton>Format</guibutton> "
"button as usual. You will get a message box asking you to verify the device "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste spremni za formatiranje, kliknite na <guibutton>Formatiraj</"
"guibutton> dugme, kao i obično. Dobit ćete poruku s pitanjem da verifikujete "
"ime uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:574
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the last chance to check the device name before formating. After it, "
"it is too late."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je posljednja prilika da provjerite naziv uređaja prije formatiranja. "
"Nakon toga, bit će prekasno."

